WEBVTT

00:00.810 --> 00:02.250
Artificial intelligence

00:02.250 --> 00:04.330
is already part of many professions.

00:04.370 --> 00:05.290
In architecture,

00:05.450 --> 00:07.150
I use AI to turn a project

00:07.370 --> 00:08.917
into a photorealistic image...

00:09.023 --> 00:10.570
before it even exists.

00:10.730 --> 00:12.570
But this isn't solved with one click,

00:12.690 --> 00:14.170
and it's not just a prompt.

00:14.250 --> 00:16.170
It takes scene reading, references,

00:16.370 --> 00:17.970
adjustments and corrections.

00:18.010 --> 00:20.130
You redo it again... and again.

00:20.170 --> 00:22.210
It's process. It's method.

00:22.250 --> 00:24.290
It's work that has to be mastered.

00:24.330 --> 00:26.450
AI doesn't replace those who know.

00:26.618 --> 00:28.200
It amplifies them.
